        <activityName xml:lang="en">xxx Wood chips, mixed, from industry, u=40%, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xxx Wood chips, mixed, from industry, u=40%, at plant
The  volume refers to the bulked volume: dried matter content = 188.6 kg/m3 dried matter (u=0%), lower heating value = 3463 MJ/m3;
Synonyms: Häcksel; 
UUID: 039c9fd8-ce1b-3456-83e8-b87ed8fff25e
Includes the chopping of the average mix of 72% residual softwood and 28% residual hardwood (reflecting Swiss average wood consumption) with a stationary chopper in the sawmill. No transports are included.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Mix
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: see Geography
Uncertainty adjustments: The assumption that Switzerland/Austria is representative for central Europe is considered in the uncertainties.
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_039c9fd8-ce1b-3456-83e8-b87ed8fff25e.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
